        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This fixes up the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCInboundRtpStreamStats\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCInboundRtpStreamStats</code></a> to match the BCD as per FF142, which adds support for some more properties.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Contributes to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1628555901\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/384\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/mdn/issues/384/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/384\">mdn/mdn#384</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249075657\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40478\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40478/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40478\">#40478</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40495",
            "title": "Ff142 rtcinboundrtpstreamstats fixes",
            "date_modified": "2025-07-22T06:17:40.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-07-22T06:15:44.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87750369?u=ccc1f52005708ae16bcb50e325e02145bff0ef7d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>related to <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/actions/runs/16405622975/job/46351087903#step:6:789\">https://github.com/mdn/content/actions/runs/16405622975/job/46351087903#step:6:789</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The workflow run threw the following error:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Error: An error occurred trying to start process '/usr/bin/bash' with working directory '/home/runner/work/content/content'. Argument list too long</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">But the underlying GraphQL error, getting shadowed in this case, is the following:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Body is too long (maximum is 65536 characters)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The workflow script created <code class=\"notranslate\">186,709</code> characters long logs. This is a rare occurrence that happened due to a platform-content <code class=\"notranslate\">addonsidebar</code> update. To avoid workflow failures in such rare cases, let us truncate the logs to fit in the GitHub issue body and add a warning at the bottom.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The fix sets max length for the logs to 64,000. Let us keep rest of the 1,536 characters for other stuff in the issue body. Also, if someone appends more info to the issue body in the future, then I think 1,536 will prevent resurgence of this issue.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Testing</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The fix has been tested here <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3251104381\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/OnkarRuikar/content/issues/51\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/OnkarRuikar/content/issues/51/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/OnkarRuikar/content/issues/51\">OnkarRuikar#51</a>, and the corresponding workflow run <a href=\"https://github.com/OnkarRuikar/content/actions/runs/16435324052/job/46444171057#step:5:27\">https://github.com/OnkarRuikar/content/actions/runs/16435324052/job/46444171057#step:5:27</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40494",
            "title": "fix(ci/spelling-check-bot): Argument list too long",
            "date_modified": "2025-07-22T06:21:46.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-07-22T06:02:29.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "OnkarRuikar",
                "url": "https://github.com/OnkarRuikar"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF142 adds support for the remaining mandatory properties of  <code class=\"notranslate\">RTCIceCandidatePairStats</code>: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCIceCandidatePairStats/totalRoundTripTime\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCIceCandidatePairStats.totalRoundTripTime</code></a>, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCIceCandidatePairStats/currentRoundTripTime\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCIceCandidatePairStats.currentRoundTripTime</code></a>, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCIceCandidatePairStats/responsesReceived\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCIceCandidatePairStats.responsesReceived</code></a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1371391\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1371391</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note and a docs typo fix.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249073360\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40476\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40476/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40476\">#40476</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40492",
            "title": "FF142 RTCIceCandidatePairStats mandatory properties - relnote",
            "date_modified": "2025-07-22T03:43:21.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-07-22T03:41:19.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF142 adds support for <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Selection/getComposedRanges\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Selection.getComposedRanges()</code></a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1903870\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1903870</a> (along with modifying <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Selection/setBaseAndExtent\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Selection.setBaseAndExtent()</code></a>,<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Selection/collapse\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Selection.collapse()</code></a>, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Selection/extend\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Selection.extend()</code></a> to accept nodes inside a shadow root)</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds the release note and removes the information from the experimental features.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249070562\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40475\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40475/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40475\">#40475</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40491",
            "title": "FF142 Selection.getComposedRanges() - Relnote/Expr",
            "date_modified": "2025-07-22T02:31:04.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-07-22T02:29:02.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF142 adds support for WebGPU API on Windows (only) in workers except for service workers.<br>\nThis adds a release note. It also updates the Experimental features with the caveats and the new preference for enabling service workers.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249064144\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40473\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40473/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40473\">#40473</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40490",
            "title": "FF142 WebGPU API supported on Windows except in serviceworker - relnote/experimental features",
            "date_modified": "2025-07-22T01:48:51.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-07-22T01:46:54.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">If found the description of the CSP sandbox value <code class=\"notranslate\">allow-same-origin</code> to be a little confusing. This rewords to match the pattern of the other values, and adds the note that the <code class=\"notranslate\">Origin</code> header will be null if this is not set.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This fell out of reviewing <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3179678765\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40093\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40093/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40093\">#40093</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40094.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3179717797\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40094\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40094/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40094\">#40094</a></p>",
