        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">I have triaged too many questions and rants related to <code class=\"notranslate\">white-space</code>'s situation as a shorthand: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3246570819\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40460\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40460/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40460\">#40460</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3184493972\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40117\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40117/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40117\">#40117</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2790915442\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37664\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/37664/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37664\">#37664</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2787764357\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37649\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/37649/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37649\">#37649</a>. While the current content is correct, it is not helpful for the reader.</p>",
